# Private working material, symlinked in from ../wiggles so this is the only
# directory anyone has to work in. NONE OF IT MAY BE COMMITTED HERE.
#
# `chemrich/wiggles` is private and `PUBLICATION-GATE.md` holds ten open items
# gating the compendium's prose: its load-bearing findings rest on preprints,
# and publishing them under this repo's name turns each into a citable public
# assertion. The plan documents also describe protean, which is private.
#
# **No trailing slashes, deliberately.** A trailing slash matches a directory
# and *not* a symlink to one, which is exactly how protean came to commit
# `viewer/node_modules` as a mode-120000 link past a `viewer/node_modules/`
# rule. Every entry below is a symlink, so every entry below is bare.
compendium
docs/plans
tools/compendium
